{"4033970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Terra Traveler", "steam_appid": 4033970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dying island. A forgotten people. A storm that never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a traveler bound to nature in ways he doesn’t yet understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terra Traveler</strong> is a top-down action-adventure RPG where you play as <strong>Xanthe</strong>, an outsider who arrives on the shattered island of <strong>Frondari</strong>, home of the gentle <strong>Leaflings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As monstrous forces spread across the land, you’ll delve into hand-crafted dungeons, uncover hidden paths, and fight to restore balance to a world being consumed by a malicious cosmic force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, caves, and ruined temples. Discover secrets that reward curiosity. Grow stronger through powerful amulets. Rest at campfires. Return to the <strong>Leafling Hideout</strong>. Prepare for what lies deeper below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a journey about courage, discovery, and finding strength you didn’t know you had.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Top-Down Action Combat </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, block, parry, and strike with precise, timing-based melee combat inspired by modern adventure games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/47e850c4e70c8ca9a7adac49003c3b52.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/47e850c4e70c8ca9a7adac49003c3b52.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/47e850c4e70c8ca9a7adac49003c3b52.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon hides secrets, unique enemies, and powerful bosses guarding rare treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration-Driven World </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden paths, environmental secrets, and rewards for players who observe their surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/848a5f477fb331dd16152824e79f63dc.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/848a5f477fb331dd16152824e79f63dc.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/848a5f477fb331dd16152824e79f63dc.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Amulet Customization System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and combine magical amulets to shape your own combat style and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/46c2f6658acacf3d13fe70ba955e8e5e.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/46c2f6658acacf3d13fe70ba955e8e5e.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/46c2f6658acacf3d13fe70ba955e8e5e.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rest &amp; Respawn System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover at campfires, regroup at the Leafling Hideout, and re-enter the world on your terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/97a5544a497e07cf9a661f68fdb3d019.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/97a5544a497e07cf9a661f68fdb3d019.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/97a5544a497e07cf9a661f68fdb3d019.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dying island. A forgotten people. A storm that never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a traveler bound to nature in ways he doesn’t yet understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terra Traveler</strong> is a top-down action-adventure RPG where you play as <strong>Xanthe</strong>, an outsider who arrives on the shattered island of <strong>Frondari</strong>, home of the gentle <strong>Leaflings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As monstrous forces spread across the land, you’ll delve into hand-crafted dungeons, uncover hidden paths, and fight to restore balance to a world being consumed by a malicious cosmic force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, caves, and ruined temples. Discover secrets that reward curiosity. Grow stronger through powerful amulets. Rest at campfires. Return to the <strong>Leafling Hideout</strong>. Prepare for what lies deeper below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a journey about courage, discovery, and finding strength you didn’t know you had.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Top-Down Action Combat </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, block, parry, and strike with precise, timing-based melee combat inspired by modern adventure games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/47e850c4e70c8ca9a7adac49003c3b52.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/47e850c4e70c8ca9a7adac49003c3b52.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/47e850c4e70c8ca9a7adac49003c3b52.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon hides secrets, unique enemies, and powerful bosses guarding rare treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/79eb8f312daad379e858b79c12718cf4.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration-Driven World </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden paths, environmental secrets, and rewards for players who observe their surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/848a5f477fb331dd16152824e79f63dc.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/848a5f477fb331dd16152824e79f63dc.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/848a5f477fb331dd16152824e79f63dc.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Amulet Customization System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and combine magical amulets to shape your own combat style and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/46c2f6658acacf3d13fe70ba955e8e5e.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/46c2f6658acacf3d13fe70ba955e8e5e.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/46c2f6658acacf3d13fe70ba955e8e5e.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rest &amp; Respawn System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover at campfires, regroup at the Leafling Hideout, and re-enter the world on your terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/97a5544a497e07cf9a661f68fdb3d019.poster.avif?t=1784036458\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/97a5544a497e07cf9a661f68fdb3d019.webm?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/extras/97a5544a497e07cf9a661f68fdb3d019.mp4?t=1784036458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A challenging top-down action RPG where you fight storm-twisted monsters, explore handcrafted dungeons, uncover hidden secrets, and forge your build with powerful amulets. Join the Leaflings on a storm-battered island and find the strength to save their world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/3f35589fef9658d412cdf8af10e7c491ff339095/header.jpg?t=1784036458", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/d4f0fadffebfe6e078559f23f3fd936566080153/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784036458", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033970/d4f0fadffebfe6e078559f23f3fd936566080153/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784036458", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> NA<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Runs on most modern PCs. </li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> A